#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.str.match.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.str.match"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.match:1
msgid "Determine if each string starts with a match of a regular expression."
msgstr "确定每个字符串是否以正则表达式的匹配开头。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.match:3
msgid ""
"Determines whether each string in the Series or Index starts with a match"
" to a specified regular expression. This function is especially useful "
"for validating prefixes, such as ensuring that codes, tags, or "
"identifiers begin with a specific pattern."
msgstr "确定 Series 或 Index 中的每个字符串是否以指定正则表达式的匹配开头。此函数对于验证前缀特别有用，例如确保代码、标签或标识符以特定模式开头。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.str.match.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.match:8
msgid "Character sequence or regular expression."
msgstr "字符序列或正则表达式。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.match:10
msgid "If True, case sensitive."
msgstr "如果为True，则区分大小写。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.match:12
msgid "Regex module flags, e.g. re.IGNORECASE."
msgstr "正则表达式模块标志，例如re.IGNORECASE。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.match:14
msgid ""
"Fill value for missing values. The default depends on dtype of the array."
" For the ``\"str\"`` dtype, ``False`` is used. For object dtype, "
"``numpy.nan`` is used. For the nullable ``StringDtype``, ``pandas.NA`` is"
" used."
msgstr "缺失值的填充值。默认值取决于数组的数据类型。对于 ``\"str\"`` 数据类型，使用 ``False``。对于对象数据类型，使用 ``numpy.nan``。对于可空的 ``StringDtype``，使用 ``pandas.NA``。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.str.match.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.match:20
msgid ""
"A Series, Index, or array of boolean values indicating whether the start "
"of each string matches the pattern. The result will be of the same type "
"as the input."
msgstr "一个 Series、Index 或布尔值数组，指示每个字符串的开头是否与模式匹配。结果将与输入具有相同的类型。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.str.match.rst
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.match:27
msgid ":py:obj:`fullmatch`"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.match:28
msgid "Stricter matching that requires the entire string to match."
msgstr "更严格的匹配，要求整个字符串匹配。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.match:30
msgid ":py:obj:`contains`"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.match:31
msgid "Analogous, but less strict, relying on re.search instead of re.match."
msgstr "类似但不那么严格，依赖于re.search而不是re.match。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.match:33
msgid ":py:obj:`extract`"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.match:34
msgid "Extract matched groups."
msgstr "提取匹配的组。"
